    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>History</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, there are floating islands, and they are almost entirely dependent on air transportation.<br>Kanahe was resting, when, suddenly, a zeppelin falls on his island, <br>destroying it and forcing him to leave there quickly in the same zeppelin, which mysteriously, <br>He barely continues to serve, so he flies through the skies, seeking to recover his peaceful life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's about a zeppelin that shoots arrows and destroys enemies (like a Martian killer) but in this case,<br>you need to think well about the shot, since you must calculate the power of the arrow, <br>since it varies depending on the gravity and the distance at which your enemy is. <br>You can acquire upgrades, skins and extra powers for your adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886850/extras/35b46590dc5db0bae9069e9fae922be1.poster.avif?t=1740509555\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886850/extras/35b46590dc5db0bae9069e9fae922be1.webm?t=1740509555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886850/extras/35b46590dc5db0bae9069e9fae922be1.mp4?t=1740509555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome linear levels full of enemies like horizontal 2D ship games but with the mechanics of shooting arrows, you have a variety of skills and powers for more fun or difficulty </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50Travel through the incredible free level selector with secrets and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50It is not necessary to go alone, you can play with someone else in the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50Acquire skills and powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50Meet characters and collect wacky enemy cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50Face bosses that impede your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50Experience the story of Kanahe, and find out what happened in this world so different from what you know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50Move your Zeppelin to the rhythm of the soundtrack, which nostalgically reminds you of your lost home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50Mainly created by a single person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>History</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, there are floating islands, and they are almost entirely dependent on air transportation.<br>Kanahe was resting, when, suddenly, a zeppelin falls on his island, <br>destroying it and forcing him to leave there quickly in the same zeppelin, which mysteriously, <br>He barely continues to serve, so he flies through the skies, seeking to recover his peaceful life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's about a zeppelin that shoots arrows and destroys enemies (like a Martian killer) but in this case,<br>you need to think well about the shot, since you must calculate the power of the arrow, <br>since it varies depending on the gravity and the distance at which your enemy is. <br>You can acquire upgrades, skins and extra powers for your adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886850/extras/35b46590dc5db0bae9069e9fae922be1.poster.avif?t=1740509555\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886850/extras/35b46590dc5db0bae9069e9fae922be1.webm?t=1740509555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886850/extras/35b46590dc5db0bae9069e9fae922be1.mp4?t=1740509555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome linear levels full of enemies like horizontal 2D ship games but with the mechanics of shooting arrows, you have a variety of skills and powers for more fun or difficulty </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50Travel through the incredible free level selector with secrets and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50It is not necessary to go alone, you can play with someone else in the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50Acquire skills and powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50Meet characters and collect wacky enemy cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50Face bosses that impede your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50Experience the story of Kanahe, and find out what happened in this world so different from what you know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50Move your Zeppelin to the rhythm of the soundtrack, which nostalgically reminds you of your lost home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50Mainly created by a single person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
